iginal path if it is too short to compress \u001b[0m\n\r    \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should return a compressed path \u001b[0m\n\n\n\u001b[92m \u001b[0m\u001b[32m 57 passing\u001b[0m\u001b[90m (43ms)\u001b[0m\nShell cwd was reset to /home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-01-test-blitz","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"431bead7-f8d6-4a32-b19f-2263c9e78722","uuid":"47477582-3378-4c29-ac19-c60e8301de29","timestamp":"2026-04-16T13:57:23.901Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 3 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 4 \u001b[0m\n\n\u001b[0m  BiBestFirst\u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 1 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 2 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 3 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 4 \u001b[0m\n\n\u001b[0m  IDAStar\u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 1 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 2 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 3 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 4 \u001b[0m\n\n\u001b[0m  JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle\u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 1 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 2 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 3 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 4 \u001b[0m\n\n\u001b[0m  JPFNeverMoveDiagonally\u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 1 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 2 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 3 \u001b[0m\n\r  \u001b[32m  ✓\u001b[0m\u001b[90m should solve maze 4 \u001b[0m\n\n\u001b[0m  Utility functions\u001b[0m\n\u001b[0m    interpo